              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namukulikha eliiralie mbu Noa, naboola ari Niye oulakhuleminjia emioyo khulwa emilimo chieefwe khandi khulwa okhunyakhana khwemikhono chieefwe, khulwa liloba lino elia OMWAMI yarumbula mbu lili mushilaamo shiobubii. ",
          "type": "text",
